\f2 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Meridius have it\'92s own software rendered cursor so it will never hijack user\'92s main cursor.\
\ls1\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	
\f2 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Meridius has an option to connect local models, so users have the option to keep everything private.\
